Repository for the first part of the semester project of IFT-3100

COMMANDS

setup: export DISPLAY=:0.0 && startxwin &
clean: rm -rf build && 
build: cmake . -B build -G "Ninja"
compile: ninja -C build 
exec: ./build/app.exe
deploy: rm -rf build && cmake . -B build -G "Ninja" && ninja -C build && ./build/app.exe

DEPENDENCIES
- ninja 
- cmake
- glfw

